---

This project is an unofficial native shell around the DeepSeek Harness (dsh)
project. It distributes no source code or compiled artefacts of dsh itself;
it only embeds a WKWebView pointed at a locally-running `dsh web` instance
that the user installs separately. dsh is licensed under its own terms
(MIT) by DeepSeek AI. See https://github.com/deepseek-ai/deepseek-harness
for the upstream project.
